	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Cum scribam ad <placeName ref="l301">Lugdunenses</placeName> mercatores, maxime <persName>Vincentium</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>qui vos adiit, reperta esse, quę perdiderat <placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, volui etiam signifficare <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>me tuas accepisse literas et sermones, quos misisti; qui sunt gratissimi <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et habeo gratiam.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Que a mercatoribus scripta sunt de clade <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>accepta a <placeName ref="l2510">Turcis</placeName>, mihi non videntur verissimilia, cum nullum illis sit <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>bellum cum <persName>rege Persarum</persName> nec tam facile tot hominum milia conficiuntur.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Nostri poste dolent papam convaluisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Expecto, quid de pace actum sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Ad ea vero, que scribis de hospite <placeName>Ciconie</placeName>, scribam ad d. <persName ref="p8183">S. Laurentianum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ut per eum intelligam, quid illi sit pollicitus, et quantum in me erit, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>curabo, ut intelligat, quantum habeat momenti tua commendatio.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Proximis comitiis puto uxorem ad vos ituram cum filio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Illa te salutat <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>et ego amicos communes.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l760">Soluturi</placeName> 3. octobris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Si <persName>Vincen<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>tius</persName>* nondum abiit, iube, ut <placeName ref="l28">Basil<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>eam</placeName> repetat et sua recuperet <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>hacque transeat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Patrem habet <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>virum optimum et pium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>An herren <persName ref="p495">Heinrichen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullinger</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[von anderer Hand; vielleicht <persName>Vincenzo Abaggi</persName>, vgl. C an HB, 15.8.1558]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
